47C19.4497 24.1632 19.5589 24.8241 19.6422 25.5574C20.3256 25.3253 21.0134 24.998 21.7057 24.5757C22.3981 24.1532 23.026 23.6039 23.5895 22.9277C24.1528 22.2514 24.6332 21.4321 25.0307 20.4699C25.4282 19.5078 25.6706 18.3677 25.7577 17.0497C25.7577 17.0164 25.7577 17.0164 25.7577 17.0497C24.1654 17.283 22.7583 17.8279 21.5365 18.6842C20.3147 19.5407 19.4063 20.6099 18.8115 21.8919Z" fill="#00503A"/>
