  {%- comment -%}
    Concern Select's 7 specialization icons (General Medicine, Orthopedics,
    Gastroenterology, Gynecology, Cardiology, Pediatrics, Neurology) all came
    from one exported sprite sheet (a 56x440 strip, one icon per ~64px row).
    Each icon's path coordinates are absolute within that strip, not
    relative to a per-icon 0-24 box, so each is wrapped in a translate that
    subtracts its row's own origin — turns the strip's absolute coordinates
    into a clean local viewBox without altering the path data itself.
  {%- endcomment -%}

